        "original_id": "ac37bc67-4a42-57f3-a9f0-adad28fe804d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Kitt, Brian Yorkey, Michael Greif, Janet Krupin\n- Works: If/Then, American Idiot, Everyday Rapture, Bring It On the Musical\n- Roles: Kylar\n- Awards: Tony Award, Outer Critics Circle Award, Drama Desk Award\n\nFacts:\n- If/Then is a musical with a libretto by Brian Yorkey, a theatrical score by Tom Kitt, and direction by Michael Greif.\n- Tom Kitt won a Tony Award and the 2008 Outer Critics Circle Award, and he received Drama Desk Award nominations for American Idiot and Everyday Rapture.\n- On Broadway, Janet Krupin originated the role of Kylar in Bring It On the Musical.\n- On Broadway, Janet Krupin was a swing in If/Then.",
